OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fclear skies overnight. Breezy at
OL,7,Ffirst, but winds will soon ease and
OL,8,Fbecome light. Turning chilly by dawn,
OL,9,Fwith a few patches of mist and fog
OL,10,Fpossible, especially in prone rural
OL,11,Fspots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,14,Fto Wednesday, with some cloud
OL,15,Fdeveloping during the afternoon.
OL,16,FRemaining dry throughout, with winds
OL,17,Fmostly light, though freshening
OL,18,Fslightly during the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
