OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCloudy and mild Thursday, with rain
OL,7,Farriving overnight. Brighter on Friday
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells and showers, before
OL,9,Fshowers become largely confined to
OL,10,Feastern areas on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
